{
  "$comment": [
    "Reference closing prices for the plan's instrument, on the days the plan uses:",
    "the 20th of February/May/August/November (the vestings) and the 1st of April and",
    "October (the ESPP purchases). When the market was shut on that day the previous",
    "close applies, and closeOn says which day it is from.",
    "close is in USD per share; eurusd is dollars per euro, so euro are MULTIPLIED to",
    "become dollars.",
    "fmv is the fair market value used to price an RSU grant: the mean of the closes of",
    "the 20 trading sessions BEFORE the date, the grant day itself excluded. That is the",
    "plan's definition and it is not the close of the day -- for 2026-02-20 the close is",
    "142.88 and the fair market value 146.32.",
    "The file updates itself: .github/workflows/refresh-quote.yml adds the row the day",
    "after each plan date. The instrument is written nowhere in the sources: its symbol",
    "lives in a GitHub secret and stays in the runner.",
    "dividends is the payment history: date, amount per share, and the close of that day.",
    "Unvested RSUs are credited with dividend equivalents at every payment -- extra units",
    "equal to (unvested x amount) / close -- so the history is needed to count units, not",
    "just to be thorough. Same provider and same secret as the prices.",
    "Source: Yahoo Finance, daily closes not adjusted for dividends."
  ],
